cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FOMO26 challenge submission — Team volBrain"
abstract: >-
  Official source-code release of Team volBrain's submission to the FOMO26 challenge: a 3D
  ResEnc-B backbone pretrained on heterogeneous brain MRI with an AMAES masked-reconstruction
  objective, fine-tuned for challenge Tasks 1-5 and used as a frozen representation extractor
  for Tasks 6-7. Includes the released pretraining and fine-tuning recipes, the preprocessing
  geometry contract, the task-specific inference entrypoints, and the container and release
  contracts. No data, checkpoints or container images are distributed. Built on the Asparagus
  framework; see the README for upstream attribution.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-09"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EloiNavet/FOMO26"
